# Model output from run-aegis-multimodel. The prompt is the input worth keeping;
# what four models said back to it is a run, and a run that times out writes
# "Generation failed" into files shaped exactly like a corpus.
corpus/aegis-multimodel/*
!corpus/aegis-multimodel/prompt.md
